<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="b089f59c-3b94-4adb-93cf-0cf484661abc" version="17">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - City Happiness</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds a popup to aid deciding which happiness building to buy in which city</Teaser>
    <Description>Makes the Happiness indicator in the top panel clickable to display a popup with two panels - Buildings and Courthouses.

The Buildings panel shows unhappiness per city and which buildings are availble in that city to buy to increase happiness.

The Courthouse panel shows annexed cities without a Courthouse (or civilization specific building) and the effect of buying a Courthouse in that city

Buildings can be bought directly from either panel by clicking the appropriate building icon.</Description>
    <Authors>William Howard</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Translation: German - AndreP; EUI Icon: Lynnes</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>http://forums.civfanatics.com/showthread.php?t=469375</Homepage>
